        "type": "game",
        "name": "Idle Pixels",
        "steam_appid": 3896540,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Pixels</strong> is a complex idle clicker game with almost infinite possibilities. Slay pixel monsters to earn money and experience. Level up, gain prestige points, and unlock powerful abilities. Fight bosses, conquer various worlds, and use every opportunity to become stronger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click or use idle damage to defeat enemies. Farm gold and other currencies to purchase hundreds of upgrades</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERMANENT UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in powerful prestige upgrades, which can also be permanently enhanced using tiers. Each upgrade requires a reset of your game progress, but it's a fair price for the bonuses you receive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERKS AND POWER-UPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete different in-game goals to unlock permanent power-ups. Just keep playing and grow stronger over time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENEMIES AND BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against <strong>hundreds</strong> of different pixel enemies. Each one has a super-powerful boss version that must be defeated to complete the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDS AND COMPLETION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all enemies and bosses to unlock new worlds. Earn incredible rewards for achieving every goal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASSIVE INCOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an interest system to earn currencies even without fighting. Deposit and withdraw each currency for receiving steady profits over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CURRENCY EXCHANGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your capital by freely converting one currency into another. No need to farm endlessly — exchange anytime!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BETS AND REWARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have very little money or an excess of it? Try your luck in the lottery! You could either lose everything or walk away with a pile of cash.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock all <strong>100 Steam achievements </strong>— a real challenge for the most hardcore players!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Pixels</strong> is a complex idle clicker game with almost infinite possibilities. Slay pixel monsters to earn money and experience. Level up, gain prestige points, and unlock powerful abilities. Fight bosses, conquer various worlds, and use every opportunity to become stronger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click or use idle damage to defeat enemies. Farm gold and other currencies to purchase hundreds of upgrades</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERMANENT UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in powerful prestige upgrades, which can also be permanently enhanced using tiers. Each upgrade requires a reset of your game progress, but it's a fair price for the bonuses you receive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PERKS AND POWER-UPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete different in-game goals to unlock permanent power-ups. Just keep playing and grow stronger over time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENEMIES AND BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against <strong>hundreds</strong> of different pixel enemies. Each one has a super-powerful boss version that must be defeated to complete the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDS AND COMPLETION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all enemies and bosses to unlock new worlds. Earn incredible rewards for achieving every goal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASSIVE INCOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an interest system to earn currencies even without fighting. Deposit and withdraw each currency for receiving steady profits over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CURRENCY EXCHANGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your capital by freely converting one currency into another. No need to farm endlessly — exchange anytime!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BETS AND REWARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have very little money or an excess of it? Try your luck in the lottery! You could either lose everything or walk away with a pile of cash.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and unlock all <strong>100 Steam achievements </strong>— a real challenge for the most hardcore players!</p>",
        "short_description": "A complex idle clicker game with infinite possibilities. Prestige, tiers, perks, bosses, different worlds, interest, bets and many more gameplay features are available!",
